<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-STATISTICS FROM BRUGUERA V RAFTER.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STATISTICS FROM BRUGUERA V RAFTER.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of Friday's French Open men's singles semifinal between Spain's Sergi Bruguera and Patrick Rafter of Australia (world ranking in brackets):</p>
<p>Bruguera won 6-7 (6-8) 6-1 7-5 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Time: two hours 53 minutes</p>
<p>				    BRUGUERA (19)     RAFTER (25)</p>
<p>    Aces				4		    4</p>
<p>    Double faults		   2		   10</p>
<p>    Percentage first serves    74		   61</p>
<p>    Forehand winners	     10		    3</p>
<p>    Backhand winners		6		    2</p>
<p>    Unforced errors		21		   46</p>
<p>    Break points		   18		   13</p>
<p>    Breaks of serve		 8		    5</p>
</text>
